# The prebuilt binaries must arrive as bytes.
#
# The `skills` CLI clones with the LFS filters explicitly disabled
# (filter.lfs.smudge= and friends), so anything LFS-tracked lands in a user's
# agent directory as a ~130-byte pointer file that fails with a message about
# nothing recognisable. Do not add these paths to LFS.
skills/narrated-video/bin/*/nv binary -filter -diff -merge

# The shim beside them is a shell script and should stay readable in a diff.
skills/narrated-video/bin/nv text eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
